  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During 1999 FOJO will arrange courses on two themes: political and social journalism. Four two-days seminars on political journalism will be held in four different cities, with 60 participants. The course also include a one-week study tour to Sweden. Ukrainian counterparts are IREX ProMedia and Internews</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fortbildning av Ukrainska journalister 1999. Kursverksamheten fokuserar p&#xe5; tv&#xe5; oika temata: politisk- och socialjournalistik. Fyra tv&#xe5;dagarsseminarier kommer att arrangeras i fyra olika st&#xe4;der, med ca 60 deltagare. Kursen kommer &#xe4;ven att inneh&#xe5;lla en veckol&#xe5;ng studie- resa till Sverige.Ukrainska samarnetsparter=IREX ProMedia/Internews</narrative>
  </description>
